& [P5RuntimeProofTraceFixturePlanAndNoLiveEffectExecutionBoundaryV1] is the P5-S05 runtime proof trace fixture plan and no-live-effect execution boundary
  + [slice_id] is P5-S05
  + [slice_name] is runtime proof trace fixture plan and no-live-effect execution boundary
  + [model_route_used] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable
