& [P5NoLiveEffectExecutionBoundary] is the no-live-effect execution boundary for future proof trace evaluation
  + [forbidden_effect] is dependency_installation
  + [forbidden_effect] is package_metadata_mutation
  + [forbidden_effect] is implementation_code_write
  + [forbidden_effect] is adapter_or_transport_effect
  + [forbidden_effect] is graph_runtime_execution_against_live_state
